            if isinstance(route, APIRoute):
                self.routes.append(APIRoute(prefix + route.path, route.name))
            elif isinstance(route, WebSocketRoute):
                self.routes.append(WebSocketRoute(prefix + route.path, route.name))'. Handle WebSocketRoute instances during router inclusion by appending a new WebSocketRoute with the prefixed path and original route name to self.routes alongside APIRoute instances.
